    "text": "WJFW-TV\nwebsite\nRhinelander\nThe Community Blood Center hopes for record blood donations at Hodag Dome on Thursday\nBy Ryan Marinaro,\n4 hours ago(WJFW) - Donations of blood typically slow down during the summer months but one organization is looking to keep consistent donations coming in this summer. The Community Blood Center set up for their annual Hodag Stat blood drive tomorrow, the biggest blood donation in the city of Rhinelander all year. The President of the Blood Center John Hagins hopes their summer tour can help make up for the slower donation months in the summer.",
